# Review 2026-09-27 — refreshed tending memory; concept refined from "move routes into site/" to "one-hop source-to-URL mapping plus four bins". No file moves are active. M0/M2 decisions shared with typescript-integration; M3 answered.
# wip — site-source-layout
#
# Hot planning memory. The April stream is preserved at the bottom as history;
# the facets above it supersede its phase register.

#>plan_site_source_layout_wip
#:operation #!cache
#:fixity #!tending
#:layer #!pragmatics

@plan: ~"./PLAN.md"
@index: ~"./index.spw"
@plans_root: ~"../../../.agents/plans/index.spw"
@wip_notebook: ~"../../../.spw/conventions/wip-notebook.spw"
